          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit's End step, if this turn was your first turn in a row, take another turn. During that turn, for each attack that targets an enemy unit visible to and within 24" of this unit, add 1 to the Hit Roll of that attack.</characteristic>
